{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1000_p", "source_sha256": "49afc6188219e7c30e3a150a80ccfcaae8796229bee8593ea1cd304735699db4", "ja": "（貴音も出演した『音楽フェスティバル』は\n無事終わった。貴音は外にいると聞いたけど……）", "zh": "（贵音也参加了演出的《音乐节》顺利结束了。听说贵音在外面，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3e9fca015cfe4499567986c9cd0fb55296a13079880704a7488f86652df59a01", "ja": "ここに居たんだな、貴音。\n今日はお疲れさま。", "zh": "原来你在这里啊，贵音。\n今天辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "28a062e04440c55394d244efd72b016d5e19815230853c5db45c52e5bcc2ccc0", "ja": "あっ。お疲れ様です、{$P$}。\n見てください。今宵は、見事な月が出ています。", "zh": "啊。辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n您看，今晚的月亮真美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1003_p", "source_sha256": "cb81a549ef4ea02c8b06abf4dc8b748960ffcc0ce1b5f8ab9ff9092a67ec495f", "ja": "お、本当だ。大きくて綺麗だな。\n月の光が、少しまぶしいくらいだ。", "zh": "哦，真的。月亮又大又漂亮。\n月光亮得都有些刺眼了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "c1cae01d03d0ed03c8911b1185c6895aafdb653fc37812966a7002d477a660ed", "ja": "ええ。力強き輝き……このような夜には、\n歌を一句したためてみたくなります。", "zh": "是的。如此强烈的光辉……在这样的夜晚，真想作歌一首。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "58c0f34fdde0166ccbbf45e48bca5779555416af32d1e31865b155f1cd1394ec", "ja": "{$P$}。和歌の中には、\n月を題材にした歌がいくつか存在しています。", "zh": "{$P$}。和歌中有几首是以月亮为题材的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "7a15139bd18c2436884aa5dde93c555be3a557b43745cb030a8d2569eda64263", "ja": "古の歌人は、趣深い景色を眺めながら\n秘めた想いを句に託したのかもしれませんね。", "zh": "古代的歌人或许曾一边眺望意境深远的景色，一边将深藏的情感寄托于诗句之中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ba5b56a531f1d15231d36b4d4d86efb654a04ac0bbd3f3be45f96fd0c998eda5", "ja": "そうだな。前に和歌の現代語訳を読んだ時も、\n同じことを感じたな。", "zh": "是啊。之前读和歌的现代译文时，我也有同样的感受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "f715b427eb36b508cd5bd64257bd0559878ca3a39e727cb8191231315ccaae7c", "ja": "何を美しいと感じるかは、人それぞれですが……\n美しきものへ感じ入る心は、皆持ち合わせているもの。", "zh": "每个人感受到的美各不相同……但对于美好事物心生感动的情怀，是人人都拥有的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "43861550a02969c51360b8c26cb4e96128d7dfdde00f2b1c2202c9851cd878b1", "ja": "先人達は、今感じた想いを表現する手段として、\n歌を用いていたのでしょう。", "zh": "前人们或许会用歌声来表达此刻感受到的心情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1010_p", "source_sha256": "04ef7c1b06234fabf78fe3ce679689108fd09ed684fc6bf2a64d8ebcd5ae296e", "ja": "なるほど。詠み手が伝えたいのは、\n句から感じ取った印象……情景や感情ということか。", "zh": "原来如此。写诗的人想要传达的，是从诗句中感受到的印象……也就是情景和情感吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "19af064cba9fe9d37af1e1361b6a156fc4be3e4d99c1c98a469fea31f90eb70a", "ja": "「桜映ゆ　道の行く先　照らす月」……。", "zh": "“樱映前行路　明月照前程”……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "909f530919e138570d0669ee34a287659366fa3c26a8298d16190a8f4f170eaf", "ja": "その……あまりうまくはありませんが……\n今宵の記念に、この歌をあなた様へ。", "zh": "那个……虽然写得不算太好……\n就把这首歌送给您，作为今夜的纪念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bfc6a84f7bbd7666cee9db391504bee9e2ab640c7f3ac560f13068eb63d7634f", "ja": "うまくないなんて……。\nもしかして、貴音が考えた歌なのか？", "zh": "怎么会唱得不好……\n难道说，这是贵音自己写的歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "307735e8d8dc57b6c90c7650b18a4ec956ca89ea7057c951791653f46fcc1918", "ja": "はい。今の心情をしたためてみたくなったのです。\nきっと、魅力的な月のせいかと。ふふ♪", "zh": "是的。我想把此刻的心情写下来。想必是因为那轮迷人的月亮吧。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "e16da9d3e8ccb10a5e3fd6a96a9f9bc2af1e44331a9f3ad08deed08bdc2fa9e1", "ja": "改めて、本日はありがとうございました。\nまた明日からも、よろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "再次感谢您今天为我做的一切。\n从明天起，也请您多多指教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8a9d3b2189dc0aecd31895acaa9b8acab3f77a8611c21f13cdd679e0764bcbe0", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ！\nこちらこそ、よろしくな。", "zh": "啊，当然了！我才要请你多多关照呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0253_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "02b821c18ee57af73903a0c2980bb45b0059267a505774028a23e26ae5050fbe", "ja": "{$P$}、ひとつお願いが。\nもう少しだけ、一緒に月を眺めませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}，我有一个请求。\n要不要再一起赏月片刻？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
